{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03266",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.53,
      "end_seconds": 4.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Um, hello, doctor. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.64,
      "end_seconds": 9.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 10.98,
      "end_seconds": 16.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.0,
      "end_seconds": 23.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "of course, please stay it's helpful to to have you here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.99,
      "end_seconds": 35.59,
      "duration_seconds": 10.6,
      "text": "I've been dealing with sudden severe pain in the lower tummy. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.63,
      "end_seconds": 40.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.56,
      "end_seconds": 48.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, ever since... since last weekend, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.58,
      "end_seconds": 51.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.42,
      "end_seconds": 63.22,
      "duration_seconds": 9.8,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get vaginal spotting as well. The vaginal spotting? That's been for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.41,
      "end_seconds": 66.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Has there been collapsing too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.36,
      "end_seconds": 69.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Yeah, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.84,
      "end_seconds": 73.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.08,
      "end_seconds": 83.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.94,
      "text": "well, yes, I had my appendix taken out, when I was in my twenties"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.64,
      "end_seconds": 86.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.9,
      "end_seconds": 89.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "I have depression."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.66,
      "end_seconds": 102.76,
      "duration_seconds": 12.1,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Right, so depression is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.79,
      "end_seconds": 107.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "my father has Parkinson's disease"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.6,
      "end_seconds": 120.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.36,
      "end_seconds": 125.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "It's fluoxetine, 20 milligrams, maybe, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.45,
      "end_seconds": 133.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Right, do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.17,
      "end_seconds": 143.48,
      "duration_seconds": 9.31,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. I used to take escitalopram, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.18,
      "end_seconds": 155.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "how about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.87,
      "end_seconds": 159.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.32,
      "end_seconds": 165.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.13,
      "end_seconds": 169.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.22,
      "end_seconds": 173.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "what do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.34,
      "end_seconds": 178.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.3,
      "end_seconds": 182.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "what does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.84,
      "end_seconds": 189.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.23,
      "end_seconds": 192.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "any sign of vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.84,
      "end_seconds": 195.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.46,
      "end_seconds": 200.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever or discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.44,
      "end_seconds": 205.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "None of those, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.34,
      "end_seconds": 210.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.88,
      "end_seconds": 213.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "no, that's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.08,
      "end_seconds": 218.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.13,
      "end_seconds": 233.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.38,
      "end_seconds": 260.62,
      "duration_seconds": 8.24,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 20, oxygen saturation is 99 percent. And temp 37.0 degrees, pressure 94 over 57, pulse 106."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.54,
      "end_seconds": 267.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.02,
      "end_seconds": 271.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.75,
      "end_seconds": 289.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "You are pale and clammy with a rigid, tender tummy and a very low blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.24,
      "end_seconds": 291.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "sure thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.24,
      "end_seconds": 306.08,
      "duration_seconds": 11.84,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Having listened and examined, it points towards a ruptured ectopic pregnancy. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.02,
      "end_seconds": 310.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "what are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.06,
      "end_seconds": 319.74,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a ruptured ectopic pregnancy is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.01,
      "end_seconds": 361.86,
      "duration_seconds": 32.85,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange urgent blood tests for internal bleeding. I'll request a pregnancy test, it'll help with collapse. I am calling the emergency team, you need an operation now. I think the emergency team should see you too. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. I'd like to see you again straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.92,
      "end_seconds": 369.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "how would you describe the plan, so we're on the same page?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.84,
      "end_seconds": 375.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "so, I come back straight away is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 377.67,
      "end_seconds": 381.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.52,
      "end_seconds": 384.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 386.9,
      "end_seconds": 388.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "take care now"
    }
  ]
}